    "message": "Parse only recent shared-operation records before an append\n\nrecord_shared_operation validated the whole shared operations state, up to\n20,000 records, on every append. Like per-tick validation it now parses the\nrecords since the previous tick; the duplicate check reads the same records,\nsince a record carries its event's realized minute, the current one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
